{%- comment -%}
  Theme style variables
  Design tokens as CSS custom properties, for components that ship their own
  CSS in a {% stylesheet %} tag instead of the compiled SCSS bundle (Horizon
  convention). Values mirror src/scss/core/vars — keep both in sync until the
  SCSS side reads from here. Rendered once in layout/theme.liquid, before the
  stylesheets, so every component can rely on the tokens.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  :root {
    --font-primary: 'MoMA Sans', arial, sans-serif;
    --font-secondary: 'MoMA Sans Store', arial, sans-serif;
    --font-weight-regular: 400;
    --color-foreground: #000;
    --color-background: #fff;
    --color-foreground-muted: #696969;
  }
</style>
